{
  "dom_id": "step-e9122",
  "name": "Example: Calculating the Variance of a Sum of Scaled Random Variables",
  "problem": "For two independent random variables $X$ and $Y,$ we have $\\textrm{Var}[X]=10$ and $\\textrm{Var}[Y]=12.$ Find $\\textrm{Var}\\left[X-2Y\\right].$",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X$ and $Y$ are independent variables, and $a$ and $b$ are constants, then \n\n$$\n\\textrm{Var}[aX+bY]=a^2\\textrm{Var}[X]+b^2\\textrm{Var}[Y].\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given data into the formula above, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\textrm{Var}\\left[X-2Y\\right]=\\left(1\\right)^2\\cdot 10+\\left(-2\\right)^2\\cdot 12 =58.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e9122\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Calculating the Variance of a Sum of Scaled Random Variables</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e9122\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n    